flowchart TB
  photos["24 labelled clothing photos<br/>Separate photos for training, validation and testing"]:::input
  photos --> train["14 training photos<br/>Grey out the shirt and supply its cutout"]:::input
  train --> frozen["Frozen Klein and VAE<br/>Save the last-step features and the known target"]:::frozen
  frozen --> learn["Fit only two matrices A and B<br/>420 updates to 16,896 numbers"]:::learn
  learn --> choose["5 validation photos<br/>Choose an epoch, then compact the adapter"]:::check
  photos -.-> choose
  choose --> test["5 unseen photos<br/>Decode both pictures and score garment pixels"]:::check
  frozen --> probe["Measure all 32 blocks on 3 training photos<br/>Rank 4,096 final inputs on all 14"]:::frozen
  probe --> change["Skip candidate blocks or lower their precision<br/>Run the same held-out photos"]:::check
  test --> camera["4 real camera and shop-product cases<br/>Render both versions for blind review"]:::input
